      x: '<p>Ba’zan o‘tmishdagi sabab <b>hozirgi</b> natijaga ta’sir qiladi: «If I <b>had studied</b> medicine, I <b>would be</b> a doctor now.» (o‘qimadim → shifokor emasman)</p><p>Yoki hozirgi holat o‘tmishdagi natijani belgilagan: «If I <b>were</b> braver, I <b>would have asked</b> her.»</p><p>Belgilar: <b>now, today, still, by now</b>.</p>',
