      x: '<p><b class="rd">make a decision / mistake / choice</b> — qaror / xato / tanlov qilmoq. <b>Bu yerda make ishlatiladi, do emas!</b> (✗ do a mistake)</p><p><b>regret + V-ing</b> — qilganimdan afsuslanmoq: «I <b>regret telling</b> her.» <b>Learn from mistakes</b> — xatolardan o‘rganmoq.</p><p>Foydali: <b>think twice</b> (ikki bor o‘ylamoq), <b>take a risk</b> (xavf qilmoq), <b>weigh up</b> (taqqoslamoq).</p>',
